; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1726  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1727  ** Description      : This interface is used by applications to retrieve the  **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1728  **                    latest tick count of the underlying STM timer. The      **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1729  **                    latest tick count in STM0_TIM0 is returned by this      **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1730  **                    interface. There are two uses of this interface.        **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1731  **                    Applications can retrieve a base tick count, add the    **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1732  **                    desired delay to the base tick count and arrive at a    **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1733  **                    terminal tick count. Applications can also then         **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1734  **                    periodically invoke this interface to determine if the  **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1735  **                    underlying timer has counted up to the terminal tick    **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1736  **                    count.                                                  **
; ..\MCAL364\McalLib\ssc\src\McalLib.c	  1737  **                                                                            **
